+// sessions S32, spaces B38 (GitHub issue 99, BACKLOG S-477): seven full
+// chips, 12 apart, of Home, Work*, Personal+, Clients*, Play, Docs* and
+// Family+ (* the session Work, + the session Personal). Work's line is on the
+// first lane, a segment under Work, Clients and Docs each and a connector
+// between each two; Personal's crosses it, so it is a lane lower; Home and
